# Cargo / build output
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Debug / profiling
*.pdb
*.dSYM/
*.profraw

# IDE / editor
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Rust analyzer / tools
/.rustc_info.json
/.cargo-lock

# Generated by rfd dialog or other temp
*.tmp

# Python MCP venv
mcp_rust_game_editor/.venv/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Agent scaffolding: generated per host by `comet init/update`, three near-identical
# copies of the same skills. `.github/` is the one that is tracked, matching the game
# repository (bevy_prince_platformer) which ignores these for the same reason.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.cursor/

# Editor scratch: the default save target of the running editor, and loose test
# fixtures and scripts that predate `tests/level1_test.rs` (neither Rust file is part
# of the crate: one is a standalone `fn main()`, the other is declared by no module).
/level.json
/test_simple.json
/test_deserialize.rs
/src/test_deser.rs
# CodeGraph's index of this repository: a SQLite database and its write-ahead log,
# rebuilt from the source on any machine that wants one, plus a running daemon's socket,
# pid and log. Per-host state, and 146 MB of it.
/.codegraph/

# >>> Comet managed project state >>>
!/.comet/
/.comet/*
!/.comet/config.yaml
# <<< Comet managed project state <<<
